  "title": "MUI virtual node-list tester firmware (all MUI targets)",
  "releaseNotes": "## Virtual MUI node-list tester firmware\n\nTester-only Meshtastic firmware for validating the MUI virtual node-list implementation across all verified MUI targets. This is not an official Meshtastic production release.\n\nBefore and after flashing, please test: add/receive 250 nodes; scroll rapidly; update an off-screen node; filter, reorder, and resync; look for stale rows, crashes, resets, or memory problems; then report device target and result.\n\nSource is pinned to RCGV1/firmware-Fork@6da76d5b60534328928267861273bf6d0b92579e with RCGV1/device-ui@d64e30d05951a43136889e412c713b45af0e81e8 and DEVICE_UI_MUI_VIRTUAL_NODE_LIST=1 enabled. Artifact hashes and build timestamp are included in this manifest.",
  "releaseTag": "mui-node-list-20260827-d64e30d",
  "buildTimestamp": "2026-08-27T20:50:12Z",
  "testerNotes": [
    "Add or receive 250 nodes on the mesh.",
    "Scroll rapidly through the MUI node list.",
    "Update an off-screen node and verify the visible rows stay correct.",
    "Filter, reorder, and resync the node list.",
    "Watch for stale rows, crashes, resets, or memory problems.",
    "Report device target, pass/fail result, and any reproduction notes."
  ],
